=== experiment: fork behaviour ===
  start (3 nodes, genesis only)              A=1 B=1 C=1  agree=False
  A mines 2 blocks, B and C idle             A=3 B=1 C=1  agree=False
  B mines 1 block (B has its own fork)       A=3 B=2 C=1  agree=False
  B syncs                                    A=3 B=3 C=1  agree=False
  C syncs                                    A=3 B=3 C=3  agree=True
  B and C each mine 1 block independently    A=3 B=4 C=4  agree=False
  B syncs (B=4 C=4: not strictly longer)     A=3 B=4 C=4  agree=False
  C syncs (C=4 B=4: not strictly longer)     A=3 B=4 C=4  agree=False
  B syncs again                              A=3 B=4 C=4  agree=False
  C syncs again                              A=3 B=4 C=4  agree=False
  C mines one more block (C=5, B=4)          A=3 B=4 C=5  agree=False
  B syncs                                    A=3 B=5 C=5  agree=False
  A mines, B syncs                           A=4 B=5 C=5  agree=False
